## Component Testing Patterns

### File Explorer Filter Testing

```ts
test('file type filters work correctly', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Images' }).click();
  await expect(page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Images' })).toHaveAttribute('data-state', 'on');

  await page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Documents' }).click();
  await expect(page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Documents' })).toHaveAttribute('data-state', 'on');

  // Clear filters
  await page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Images' }).click();
  await expect(page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Images' })).toHaveAttribute('data-state', 'off');
});
```

### File Selection Counter Testing

