## Handling Async Operations

### Downloads

```ts
const downloadPromise = page.waitForEvent('download');
await page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Download Report' }).click();
const download = await downloadPromise;
await download.saveAs('tmp/report.csv');
```

> Use the `download` event and `saveAs`.

### Clipboard

```ts
// in test setup, once per context
// await context.grantPermissions(['clipboard-read', 'clipboard-write']);

// later in the test
const text = await page.evaluate(() => navigator.clipboard.readText());
await expect(text).toContain('Report copied');
```

> Grant permissions via `context.grantPermissions([...])`, then read with `navigator.clipboard`.

