## Anti-Patterns: What NOT to Do

### Timing

```ts
// ❌ Avoid hard sleeps
await page.waitForTimeout(200);
```

> Replace with web-first assertions or events.

### Text / Role Matching

```ts
// ❌ Over-broad name matching can hit multiple elements
await page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Settings' }).click();

// ✅ Use anchored regex for exact visible label
await page.getByRole('button', { name: /^Settings$/ }).click();
```

> By default, string matches are substring & case-insensitive—refine with regex or filters; avoid relying on `{ exact: true }` unless your version guarantees it for the specific locator.

### Directory Expansion

```ts
// ❌ Clicking chevrons blindly
await folderRow.locator('button[aria-label="Expand folder1 directory"]').click();

// ✅ Prefer ARIA + assertion, or fallback to filter + Expand All
```

