## Reference & Commands

### Test Commands

```bash
# Run all e2e tests
pnpm test:e2e

# Headed mode for debugging
pnpm test:e2e -- --headed

# UI Mode (time-travel debugging, locator picker)
pnpm exec playwright test --ui

# Generate & open HTML report
pnpm test:e2e -- --reporter=html
pnpm exec playwright show-report

# Run specific test file
pnpm test:e2e -- file-explorer.spec.ts

# Run tests by tag or pattern
pnpm test:e2e -- --grep "@smoke"
```

> `show-report` opens the last HTML report; UI Mode provides watch/time-travel debugging.

